  "description": "**Epic Name:** Enhancements\n\n**Epic Summary**\n\nThis epic is a bucket for enhancements that are identified during the Zimmermann Magento → SFCC implementation. It covers a range of functional areas and is not tied to a single domain. Enhancements are features or improvements that are out of the core go-live scope but have been logged for consideration during the build phase.\n\n**Business Value / Objective**\n\nCapturing enhancements in a single backlog ensures nothing gets lost, while keeping them separate from committed scope maintains delivery focus and predictability.\n\n**Assumptions & Constraints**\n\n- All enhancement stories require approval from project management before being picked up in build — business need, solution direction, and effort must be documented and signed off first",
