  "summary": "Returns – Size Swap / Exchange via Narvar",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18251",
  "description": "**Sub-Functional Area:** Exchanges\n\n**Description:** Size swap / exchange capability via Narvar\n\n**Status:** Under Review\n\n**Notes:**\n\n- Notes: Exchanges not currently offered. Interest in enabling size swaps through Narvar; product swaps out of scope for the time being. Requires third-party SOW changes, stock reservation design, and process design. Exchanges were removed from Magento due to absence of stock reservation at time of request, resulting in ~50% failure rate. Any future exchange enablement via Narvar must include a stock reservation mechanism. (see ZIMBAU-5392)\n- Accenture Additional Notes: Largely sits outside of SFCC scope. Would an exchange be a different URL to return? Or same URL. If different URL, this would be build effort.\n- Zimm Response: Same Narvar return link\n- Accenture Notes: Not SFCC scope\n\n**Sizing:** 0 days",
