{"result":"{
  "id": "18302",
  "key": "SFCC-184",
  "summary": "PLP UI – Quick Add to Wishlist",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18302",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n\n**I want** to save a product to my wishlist directly from the PLP, \n\n**so that** I can keep track of items I'm interested in without having to visit each product page.\n\n\n\nImage for reference: \n\n![\"image-20260717-004857.png\"](image-20260717-004857.png)\n\n![\"image-20260722-231623.png\"](image-20260722-231623.png)\n\n\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the size selection modal triggered when a shopper taps the wishlist icon on a PLP tile. On tap or click, an authenticated shopper is prompted to select a size before the item is saved to their wishlist at SKU/size level. A guest shopper is prompted to log in or create an account before proceeding. Wishlist page, wishlist management, and cross-session persistence are covered in SFCC-8 (Wishlist).",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Refinement",
