{"result":"{
  "id": "18268",
  "key": "SFCC-156",
  "summary": "Account Registration — Duplicate Account Prevention & Apple Hide My Email",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18268",
  "description": "As a Shopper,\\nI want the system to prevent duplicate accounts being created for my email address, including when I use Apple's Hide My Email feature,\\nso that my order history, wishlist, and account details remain consolidated under a single account regardless of how I registered.\\n\\nThis story addresses two related scenarios raised in refinement: (1) general duplicate account prevention at registration and email change, and (2) the Apple Hide My Email relay address scenario, where a customer registers with a private Apple relay address that does not match their real email, creating a duplicate account risk. This story is a dependency for SFCC-135 (Social Login via Apple ID).",
